        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gina Rodriguez, Rafael Solano, Justin Baldoni, Majo Tenorio, Beverly, Andrea Fleytas\n- Works: Jane the Virgin (season 1), Filly Brown, The Bold and the Beautiful, Deepwater Horizon\n- Topics: television casting, episode count, character portrayals\n\nFacts:\n- Jane the Virgin season 1 consisted of 22 episodes.\n- In Jane the Virgin season 1, Gina Rodriguez starred as a young Latina university student who is accidentally artificially inseminated with the sperm of her boss, Rafael Solano.\n- Justin Baldoni portrayed Rafael Solano in Jane the Virgin season 1.\n- Gina Rodriguez portrayed Majo Tenorio in the musical-drama film Filly Brown.\n- Gina Rodriguez portrayed Beverly in the soap opera The Bold and the Beautiful.\n- Gina Rodriguez portrayed Andrea Fleytas in Deepwater Horizon.",
